{
    "title": "Word Go: Word Link Puzzle",
    "description": "No limits, infinite tries. Play Word Link 10 mins a day to help you exercise your brain, improve your vocabulary and spelling skills, develop thinking and have fun in the process.\r\n\r\nThis text twist of a word game is tremendous brain challenging fun. Connect letters in any direction to form the hidden word matches, and you will never experience a dull moment after trying this addicting word puzzle game. Lovers of classic word games like Scrabble, crosswords,  or anagrams will love this word hunt and spell vocabulary game.\r\n\r\nThere's a whole word of wonders to explore in this free crossword puzzle. You will start with few letters as an unique clue, you can test your brain to write and create new words from scratch. And connect all of them to get the final crossword solution. There are extra words to find on each level if you want to make a puzzle more challenging.\r\n\r\nYou will travel around this fun world of word link. Immerse yourself into the beautiful scenery backgrounds to relax and escape from the stresses of daily life. Play offline, anywhere, anytime!\r\n\r\n<b>Word Link -puzzle game features:</b>\r\n- \ud83c\udf8a Get your word hunt on more than 2000+ levels.\r\n- \ud83c\udf89 Free and offline game.\r\n- \ud83e\uddd0 Sharp your mind :  power up your memory and improve your spelling skills.\r\n- \ud83e\udd29 Challenge everyday: solve daily puzzles to get great rewards.\r\n- \ud83c\udfae Simple and accessible: fun and educational for all ages\r\n\r\nWord Link will test your vocabulary as you discover the wonders filled with challenging levels. Join the word game community now. Test yourself with this fun and free challenging game!",
    "descriptionHTML": "No limits, infinite tries. Play Word Link 10 mins a day to help you exercise your brain, improve your vocabulary and spelling skills, develop thinking and have fun in the process.<br><br>This text twist of a word game is tremendous brain challenging fun. Connect letters in any direction to form the hidden word matches, and you will never experience a dull moment after trying this addicting word puzzle game. Lovers of classic word games like Scrabble, crosswords,  or anagrams will love this word hunt and spell vocabulary game.<br><br>There&#39;s a whole word of wonders to explore in this free crossword puzzle. You will start with few letters as an unique clue, you can test your brain to write and create new words from scratch. And connect all of them to get the final crossword solution. There are extra words to find on each level if you want to make a puzzle more challenging.<br><br>You will travel around this fun world of word link. Immerse yourself into the beautiful scenery backgrounds to relax and escape from the stresses of daily life. Play offline, anywhere, anytime!<br><br><b>Word Link -puzzle game features:</b><br>- \ud83c\udf8a Get your word hunt on more than 2000+ levels.<br>- \ud83c\udf89 Free and offline game.<br>- \ud83e\uddd0 Sharp your mind :  power up your memory and improve your spelling skills.<br>- \ud83e\udd29 Challenge everyday: solve daily puzzles to get great rewards.<br>- \ud83c\udfae Simple and accessible: fun and educational for all ages<br><br>Word Link will test your vocabulary as you discover the wonders filled with challenging levels. Join the word game community now. Test yourself with this fun and free challenging game!",
